# Cloudflare static-asset headers. Branch previews (https://<branch>-elenz.elenz.workers.dev) serve the whole site;
# keep them out of search engines so Google doesn't treat them as copies of elenz.co.nz. (A placeholder matches one
# label of the host.) The Worker adds the same header to the responses it makes itself (worker/index.js).
https://:preview.elenz.workers.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

# Security headers for every static file. The Worker sends the same list on its own responses (SECURITY_HEADERS in
# worker/index.js); worker/tests/worker.test.js checks the two agree.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=2592000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
